      "content": "Thanks, this is a good start. Could you maybe make it a little bit more personal? Just a tiny bit more warmth so it doesn't feel like a total template, but keep it strictly professional. Maybe add a sentence about how we'll keep their resume on file for future openings that might be a better fit?",
